{"results":[{"url":"https://community.articulate.com/discussions/discuss/multiple-attempts-for-ungraded-text-entry-questions-survey/1200855","final_url":"https://community.articulate.com/discussions/discuss/multiple-attempts-for-ungraded-text-entry-questions-survey/1200855","title":"Multiple Attempts for Ungraded Text Entry Questions (Survey) | E-Learning Heroes","description":"Hello,I have a lesson designed with ungraded text entry questions. They serve as more of a guided exercise, rather than an assignment--there are \"right\"...","language":"en","text":"## Forum Discussion\n\nBOASTProgram\n\nCommunity Member\n\n2 years ago\n\n# Multiple Attempts for Ungraded Text Entry Questions (Survey)\n\nHello,\n\nI have a lesson designed with ungraded text entry questions. They serve as more of a guided exercise, rather than an assignment--there are \"right\" answers, but we aren't trying to assess whether their response is correct, often because the response is a few sentences and there isn't a good way to automatically assess those. Instead, we provide an answer after their response and the user compares the answer they entered (and which we can see in the SCORM report) with the answer they are shown. They can then see how close they were and adjust their learning.\n\nThe issue we're running into is that because these text entry questions are ungraded, we are not able to provide multiple attempts. Sometimes users accidentally submit something they don't intend or, because completion of the lesson **IS** graded, they are prompted by the course instructor to go back resubmit because they didn't answer the questions (provided nonsense answers instead). At the moment the only way to resubmit is to completely restart the lesson and often that wastes a lot of time.\n\nIs there any way I can give students multiple attempts for text entry questions? Or do I need to suggest this as a new idea (frustrating, since those take a long time to go into effect and this functionality already exists for graded questions...)?\n\nstoryline 360","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":20924.019355000382,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}